WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:15.628
Jason looked sad as he came into Kids Central.

2
00:00:17.168 --> 00:00:18.369
"What's the matter, Jason?"

3
00:00:18.689 --> 00:00:19.410
Ethan asked.

4
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:24.372
"My dad usually picks me up on Wednesdays for pizza," Jason said.

5
00:00:24.392 --> 00:00:26.854
"But he's on another business trip."

6
00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:29.415
"Will he be back soon?"

7
00:00:29.855 --> 00:00:30.576
Ethan asked.

8
00:00:31.412 --> 00:00:32.412
Jason sighed.

9
00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.173
"I'm not sure.

10
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:35.353
Maybe tomorrow."

11
00:00:35.373 --> 00:00:40.815
"Everyone, sit down," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:00:40.835 --> 00:00:44.156
"Today we're going to cook—and do art!"

13
00:00:48.297 --> 00:00:50.637
"Yes!" Jason cheered up a little bit.

14
00:00:50.997 --> 00:00:52.898
He liked both cooking and doing art.

15
00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:57.499
"I hope we're going to decorate cupcakes," Izzie said.

16
00:00:57.519 --> 00:01:00.040
"Nope," Miss Shelly said.

17
00:01:00.628 --> 00:01:02.650
"We're making veggie faces."

18
00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.911
"Veggie faces?"

19
00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.792
Jason made a face.

20
00:01:07.353 --> 00:01:09.034
That didn't sound very interesting.

21
00:01:10.275 --> 00:01:11.996
Nina passed out slices of bread.

22
00:01:14.118 --> 00:01:15.799
Bobby started to take a bite of his.

23
00:01:15.819 --> 00:01:18.501
"Don't eat it yet, Bobby!"

24
00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:19.421
Nina said.

25
00:01:19.441 --> 00:01:22.063
"They're for our veggie faces."

26
00:01:23.204 --> 00:01:25.586
Miss Shelly pointed to some ingredients on the table.

27
00:01:25.606 --> 00:01:28.768
"First spread your bread with peanut butter.

28
00:01:29.852 --> 00:01:33.033
Then comes the fun part—making faces."

29
00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:36.195
Jason spread peanut butter on his bread.

30
00:01:37.335 --> 00:01:39.016
Then he looked at the bowls of vegetables.

31
00:01:40.476 --> 00:01:45.538
There were carrots, peas, celery, bean sprouts, peppers, radishes, and more.

32
00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:50.300
"Use several different kinds of vegetables," Miss Shelly said.

33
00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.961
"They will be the features on your face."

34
00:01:54.002 --> 00:01:56.683
"I'm not using peas," Ethan said.

35
00:01:56.703 --> 00:01:58.724
"But I'm going to use peppers."

36
00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:01.814
Everyone started making veggie faces.

37
00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:05.417
Izzie took a spoonful of carrots for hair.

38
00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.942
Then she used peas on top of cucumber slices for eyes.

39
00:02:12.783 --> 00:02:14.324
She used an olive for a nose.

40
00:02:15.445 --> 00:02:17.067
Nina used parsley for hair.

41
00:02:17.787 --> 00:02:19.448
She made eyes with black olives.

42
00:02:20.529 --> 00:02:21.590
A pepper was the mouth.

43
00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:24.032
"This is fun!"

44
00:02:24.433 --> 00:02:24.933
she said.

45
00:02:25.714 --> 00:02:28.076
Bobby made some eyes with radishes and olives.

46
00:02:28.768 --> 00:02:31.049
Then he used cucumbers for a pair of big ears.

47
00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.671
A round carrot slice was the nose.

48
00:02:34.391 --> 00:02:37.233
He laughed as he stuck celery on each side of the nose.

49
00:02:38.253 --> 00:02:40.635
"Are those whiskers?"

50
00:02:41.075 --> 00:02:41.755
Ethan asked.

51
00:02:42.356 --> 00:02:43.276
Bobby laughed.

52
00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.458
"Yep. I'm making a rabbit."

53
00:02:47.699 --> 00:02:50.280
Ethan's veggie snack had olive slices for eyes.

54
00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.761
He made hair from bean sprouts.

55
00:02:52.781 --> 00:02:57.064
"I'm making a vampire," he said.

56
00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.881
He made fangs from pieces of radish.

57
00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:01.842
Then he took a big bite.

58
00:03:01.862 --> 00:03:06.924
"Delicious!" Jason sat quietly.

59
00:03:08.044 --> 00:03:10.786
He was thinking about some things he'd learned at his art class.

60
00:03:10.806 --> 00:03:15.988
"Eyes usually go about halfway down the face," he remembered.

61
00:03:17.048 --> 00:03:18.509
He used some peas for eyes.

62
00:03:19.209 --> 00:03:23.051
Then he added carrot slices for glasses and peppers for a baseball cap.

63
00:03:23.751 --> 00:03:25.032
A red pepper was the mouth.

64
00:03:26.432 --> 00:03:28.514
Miss Shelly stood behind him, watching.

65
00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:32.116
"That looks like you, Jason," she said.

66
00:03:32.136 --> 00:03:34.998
"But I hope your dad gets back soon.

67
00:03:35.999 --> 00:03:38.420
Even your veggie face looks a little sad."

68
00:03:39.981 --> 00:03:41.402
Suddenly the door opened.

69
00:03:41.422 --> 00:03:44.724
"Dad!" Jason yelled.

70
00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:46.906
He popped up to hug his father.

71
00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.748
"Ready for pizza?"

72
00:03:50.008 --> 00:03:50.648
Dad said.

73
00:03:50.668 --> 00:03:53.490
"Yes," Jason said.

74
00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.772
"After I eat my snack."

75
00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:02.020
Jason's dad looked down at the veggie snack.

76
00:04:03.262 --> 00:04:05.846
"That is one sad-looking face, kiddo."

77
00:04:05.866 --> 00:04:07.729
"Not anymore!"

78
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.753
Jason turned the red pepper mouth around.

79
00:04:10.773 --> 00:04:14.620
"You turned my frown upside down!"
